            "created_at": "2025-08-29T22:46:47.91812+00:00",
            "notes": "Alright baby, it's Whambulance time. The idea here is to maximize our healing on low health targets with [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4),   [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9), [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124), and [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f).\n\nVanadium Injection gives you a variety of boosts to your stats across the board that allows you to get value out of your staff and Whambulance without necessarily needing to sacrifice one for the other. The main caveat is that you really just don't want to use Valkyrie once you get it unless absolutely necessary for your survival, as that Vanadium Injection is the core of this build's power.",
