        {
            "id": "3dfc41fa-91ff-43d3-8865-c9443038083f",
            "build_id": "644435e4-eee4-4db7-a82b-3bdfaad26304",
            "round_number": 4,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-29T22:46:48.190061+00:00",
            "notes": "[Angelic Acrobatics](item_baad85fc-3da5-43af-ad9d-f17885f59aa5) is one of the most important parts of this build, as it allows you access to [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) and [The Whambulance](item_67e91029-d0fc-4c9d-9733-ec7e1cc064a9) as well as improving your survivability in general.\n\nWith 25% weapon power and 10% weapon speed from [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f), the 25% healing increase from [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4), and the 15% increase from [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124), we can output 115.5hps to a target below 50% health. This also does not take into account Whamublance's extra healing at all, which is further boosted by Triage Unit. When everything goes well, this build can push Mercy's single-target healing well over 200hps.",
