            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-29T22:46:48.419531+00:00",
            "notes": "I, personally, like to grab [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) here, but you could also grab [Protective Beam](item_3f1ef995-8ecc-45fb-8b57-26fdccc21feb) as it allows you to avoid losing your beam tether to an active tank so you have a bigger window to activate GA from. Your survivability should be enhanced with [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) already, but this can make you super tanky and very difficult for the enemy to kill if they don't have any really bursty damage. \n\nIf you think you'll struggle to stay alive even with high mobility and Serenity, you can always grab [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8). This regenerates 50 armor or shields every time you use an ability, which you will be able to spam almost constantly due to GA having a 1.3 second cooldown with Vanadium Injection up.",
