            "notes": "Here we find ourselves at the zenith of Mercy's kit. With everything working, we're at 35% weapon power, 105% ability power, 10% weapon speed, 10% cooldown reduction, and 10% movement speed. Her staff should be doing around 125hps with TU, AA, and VI. Whambulance should do a whopping 8 extra healing per meter traveled BEFORE Triage Unit, allowing you to get 10 health per meter traveled with Triage Unit up. This can allow Mercy to do between 250-300 healing when your targets are low HP, instantly bursting them back up.\n\nThis build is extremely potent at healing, mobility, and survivability.",
